  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">¡HOY EL GIMNASIO SE LLENA DE DEPORTE! <img alt=\"🔥\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t50/1/16/1f525.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👦\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tc/1/16/1f466.png\"/><img alt=\"👧\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8d/1/16/1f467.png\"/> TALLER DE FUTSAL Y HANDBALL</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Un espacio para que niños y jóvenes puedan moverse, aprender, compartir y disfrutar del deporte. <img alt=\"💪\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f4aa.png\"/><img alt=\"💙\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f499.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🚫\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6f/1/16/1f6ab.png\"/><img alt=\"🍺\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t15/1/16/1f37a.png\"/> SIN DROGA NI ALCOHOL</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Porque el deporte también es una forma de elegir una vida activa y saludable. <img alt=\"🏃‍♀️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1/16/1f3c3_200d_2640.png\"/><img alt=\"🏃‍♂️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tab/1/16/1f3c3_200d_2642.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png\"/> HOY, MARTES 22</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"⏰\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png\"/> 18:00 HRS.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> GIMNASIO DEL LICEO CARELMAPU <img alt=\"🏫\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t28/1/16/1f3eb.png\"/><img alt=\"🏟️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8d/1/16/1f3df.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👨‍🏫\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb5/1/16/1f468_200d_1f3eb.png\"/> Monitor encargado: Julián Ruiz</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🔥