 <img alt=\"🏆\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbe/1/16/1f3c6.png\"/><img alt=\"💪\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f4aa.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> Lugar: Gimnasio de Maullín</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"⏰\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png\"/> Horarios y partidos:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"⚽\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/taf/1/16/26bd.png\"/> 17:30 hrs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👦\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tc/1/16/1f466.png\"/> Escuelas de Fútbol Maullín <img alt=\"🆚\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td1/1/16/1f19a.png\"/> Carelmapu</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🥉\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t96/1/16/1f949.png\"/> 