isplay='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f499.png\"/><img alt=\"⚽\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/taf/1/16/26bd.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png\"/> Viernes 25 de septiembre</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> Gimnasio de Maullín</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🎟️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f39f.png\"/> Entrada y participación para disfrutar junto a la comunidad</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏃‍♂️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tab/1/16/1f3c3_200d_2642.png\"/><img alt=\"⚽\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/taf/1/16/26bd.png\"/> ¡El fútbol también nos une!</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"💙\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f499.png\"/> Maullín, deporte para todas y todos.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragr